.TH NEO-CLOCK 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-clock \- clock for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-clock
.RB [ \-\-ringing ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS DeskClock rebuilt in GTK 4: alarms, world clocks, timers, the stopwatch and the screen saver. It is D-Bus activatable as neo.Clock. With \-\-ringing it shows the full-screen ringing alarm and the expired timers, as the alarm service starts it.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-clock-alarms(1)
